sound 7ZV.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That girl has a future in front of her.
sound 7ZW.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And it's a truly promising future.
sound 7ZX.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That girl is different from you.
sound 7ZY.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I'm not necessarily saying you are a bad person.
sound 7ZZ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Students like you pop up once in a while. And I intend to be understanding of that.
text The teacher makes a complete 180 from before, and talks as if to only gently admonish me.
sound 800.aac
text @[Teacher]
text However, you being with that girl will not be good for her.
sound 801.aac
text @[Teacher]
text The directions you two ought be going in life are different.
sound 802.aac
