text I see...
text The teacher puts his hand on his chin, and breathes out a deep sigh.
text Somehow I feel like I just made enemies with everyone in this school.
text All of them are supporting Tomoyo.
text And I keep insisting on being a burden on her, like some kind of plague.
text Tomoyo is trying to hold my hand, and pull me up along with her.
text But since I am just a plague, a plague is all I can be.
