text Tomoya...
sound 80D.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text What are you so angry about...? I want you to tell me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound 80E.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text You always look like you're so angry.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm not angry at all.
sound 80F.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text No, you're angry.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why do you think that?
sound 80G.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It feels... like you're trying to push me away.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's just your imagination.
sound 80H.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I mean, you've even... stopped kissing me...
text @[Tomoya]
text That's all...?
sound 80I.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Have you gotten tired of it...?
