sound 80K.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I was thinking we really did it far, far too much...
label 22
text I wonder what kind of face Tomoyo's making while holding the receiver on the other end of the call.
text I couldn't imagine Tomoyo's face as she grumbled petty things like this.
sound 80L.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Say, Tomoya... What is it that's rubbing you the wrong way? I want you to tell me.
text For her to become so desperate like this... Have I changed in some way?
text I didn't notice.
text However... that's not Tomoyo's fault.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's not your fault.
text And so, that's exactly what I said.
sound 80M.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text What is it, then...? If it's not my fault, then what's going on?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 80N.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I want you to tell me. I'll help you.
text Tomoyo would say this, just for me.
text I'm certain that, no matter what troubles I'm going through, I'd be able to face them head on if I had Tomoyo with me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah... But it's hard to talk about.
sound 80O.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Why? And why are you telling me this so late?
text She must be relieved knowing it's not her fault; her voice sounding cheerful now.
sound 80P.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I'm your girlfriend, you know. You can consult me in confidence.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, you really are reliable, aren't you?
sound 80Q.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yup, I'm confident I wouldn't lose to just any old guy's girlfriend in that aspect.
text @[Tomoya]
text But, well, it's embarrassing... So it's fine.
sound 80R.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Why's it embarrassing?
sound 80S.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Wait... I think I can hazard a guess.
text @[Tomoya]
text A guess?
sound 80T.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I guess it really is my fault...
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound 80U.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's why it's "hard to talk about" and "embarrassing," right?
text That's something I just randomly said to lead you around, though...
sound 80V.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text So now I understand why you wouldn't kiss me, either...
sound 80W.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text You were sulking, weren't you...
text She's already come to terms with this herself.
sound 80X.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I guess you really are a lech, huh?
text ...That's definitely not it.
sound 80Y.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text So I've been thinking about that.
text Most likely, this girl remembered how I was discontent with her not letting me do anything more than kiss her...
text And so now she's decided that that's the reason I'm giving her the cold shoulder.
text If I deny this, then she'll probably ask me again for my reasons, so I'll just let her think that for now...
sound 80Z.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text At any rate, I'm really glad I was able to talk to you today, Tomoya.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why, thank you.
sound 810.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I think you and I really are a good match for one another.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that so?
