text Yes, that's definitely what I think.
sound 812.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That's why...
sound 813.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I want you to have confidence in us.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's both have confidence.
