text The bottom of the hill.
text I promised Tomoyo I'd meet her here.
text I firmly continue waiting for Tomoyo to come down the hill.
text The students coming home from school had already dispersed.
sound 815.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Hey, you.
text One of them suddenly calls out to me.
text A familiar face...
text An acquaintance of Tomoyo... I think he's probably a member of the student council.
sound 816.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Where is Sakagami?
text And now, as I hear the tone of his voice, I remember.
text I'd already met him long before that.
text That's right. He was the guy who started talking to me at the bottom of the hill during my suspension.
text @[Tomoya]
text Still no respect for your seniors, eh?
sound 817.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I already told you, don't sweat such small stuff.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm just surprised that attitude of yours hasn't changed, despite now being in the student council.
sound 818.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Well, someone who'd change just because of that wouldn't be very trustworthy.
text @[Tomoya]
text I guess so...
sound 819.aac
text @[Male Student]
text So, where's Sakagami?
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't know.
sound 81A.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Really?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I stay silent and convince him with my eyes.
sound 81B.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But aren't you about to go home together?
text @[Tomoya]
text Who knows?
sound 81C.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Isn't that why you're standing around here?
sound 81D.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I can't imagine it'd be for anything other than her.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 81E.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I understand. It's all right if you don't answer.
sound 81F.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But in exchange, I'll be waiting here with you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Please don't.
sound 81G.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Why?
text @[Tomoya]
text It's weird if two guys stand around together in a place like this.
sound 81H.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Now, don't say that.
text Without my approval, the guy stands right next to me in such a way as to not block pedestrians.
sound 81I.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Did you know there was a bit of an uproar just now?
text He continues looking straight ahead as he says this.
sound 81J.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Some trouble occurred after Sakagami disappeared earlier.
sound 81K.aac
text @[Male Student]
text We now have to all immediately convene and discuss the matter, and work out a plan together.
sound 81L.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But if the student council president isn't present, we can't even start up the discussion.
sound 81M.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Even now, the situation is getting worse by the hour.
sound 81N.aac
text @[Male Student]
text It might actually end up with Sakagami taking the blame.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 81O.aac
text @[Male Student]
text And, frustratingly, that girl is popular.
sound 81P.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Nobody will hear of just starting the meeting without the people who just aren't there.
sound 81Q.aac
text @[Male Student]
text It's because she doesn't have any desires for herself.
sound 81R.aac
text @[Male Student]
text It's almost refreshing how she always picks out exactly the right plan that will make lots of people happy.
sound 81S.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Even if she ends up getting the short end of the stick, she doesn't mind.
sound 81T.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm certain nobody had anyone like that around them.
sound 81U.aac
text @[Male Student]
text That's the appeal she has to people.
sound 81V.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Everybody likes her.
sound 81W.aac
text @[Male Student]
text And that's why nobody will say anything bad about her.
sound 81X.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Even this time.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 81Y.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But I'm different.
sound 81Z.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm different from the other guys.
sound 820.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I want to scold her. I want to straighten out the bad parts about her as well.
sound 821.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Because if she has an objective in all this...
sound 822.aac
text @[Male Student]
text ...I don't think she'll be able to achieve it, if this goes on.
sound 823.aac
text @[Male Student]
text And I want to see for myself what goals she can achieve.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 824.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Say, how are your grades this year?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 825.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Has your name ever been on the poster?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...It hasn't.
sound 826.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Ah, that so? Well, that's just as I expected, though.
sound 827.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But if so, won't that mean you won't even be able to see for yourself where she finally ends up?
sound 828.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Besides, that girl's a hard worker.
sound 829.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm certain that no matter what dreams she has, they'll come true.
sound 82A.aac
text @[Male Student]
text That's how she makes me feel about her.
sound 82B.aac
text @[Male Student]
text And I'd like to watch her through until the end.
sound 82C.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm sure she'll be able to go amazingly far in life.
sound 82D.aac
text @[Male Student]
text And if you follow her, there'll be an incredible view waiting for you.
sound 82E.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Don't you want to see where she'll go?
sound 82F.aac
text @[Male Student]
text That's possible for us, at least.
sound 82G.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Since right now, we're members of the same student council.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 82H.aac
text @[Male Student]
text But you're different, aren't you?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 82I.aac
text @[Male Student]
text You won't be able to do that.
sound 82J.aac
text @[Male Student]
text And that's not all.
sound 82K.aac
text @[Male Student]
text All because you're here, she's come to a standstill now.
sound 82L.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Even though there are great heights she's supposed to be aiming for.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 82M.aac
text @[Male Student]
text You understand this, right?
text @[Tomoya]
